00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:50.409
- [Narrator] Dr. José Luis Mosso Vazquez

00:00:50.409 --> 00:00:53.290
is a surgeon at the Panamerican University

00:00:53.290 --> 00:00:54.920
in Mexico City.

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:57.737
Dr. Mosso uses virtual
reality as a painkiller

00:00:57.737 --> 00:01:01.078
in the operating room, allowing
him to use local anesthetic

00:01:01.078 --> 00:01:03.678
instead of putting his patients under.

00:01:03.678 --> 00:01:07.761
(speaking in a foreign language)

00:01:14.223 --> 00:01:17.223
He operates on patients
with afflictions like cysts

00:01:17.223 --> 00:01:21.052
and tumors, using VR to distract them.

00:01:21.052 --> 00:01:25.135
(speaking in a foreign language)

